# Wave T29 (Lilac kit): gridfloor — Lilac City's registered
# street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix;
# the desire-path tiers key on it). The BRONZE SETT GRID: a fine
# 4x4 lattice of small bronze setts, grout-dark seams, worn pale
# faces, and ONE teal-glass accent sett per tile — the electric
# grid PELL says the gym leader built by hand, humming under
# the crossroads. Structurally a fine sett lattice + accent,
# not a recolour: Copperton's flags are big SQUARE quarry
# slabs (a 2x2 flag grid, four times coarser, no accent),
# Fairhaven's are long running-bond slabs, Mistford's timber
# planks, Redwood's gravel speckle. The lattice fineness reads
# at screenshot scale.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T29-LILAC-PLAN.md.)
